# The falsifier's one exemption (panel 235's R6 and R12, W4 restated
# 2026-11-07): a `path` entry mistyped to name another folder of the same
# module names compiles that folder's code, and every compilation that reads
# it says so on stderr, naming the folder as unverified.
use <json>/parse

function main()
    print(parse.value())
